ions":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"offset"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"key","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PartialKeyPath","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/PartialKeyPath","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s14PartialKeyPathC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12MemoryLayoutO1Txmfp"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"key","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A key path referring to storage that can be accessed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through a value of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offset in bytes from a pointer to a value of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"},{"type":"text","text":" to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pointer to the storage referenced by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if no such offset"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is available for the storage referenced by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"text":". If the value is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", it can be because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"type":"text","text":" is computed, has observers, requires"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reabstraction, or overlaps storage with other properties."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use this method to find the distance in bytes that can be added","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a pointer of type ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"},{"text":" to get a pointer to the property referenced by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"text":". The offset is available only if the given key refers to inline,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directly addressable storage within the in-memory representation of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the return value of this method is non-","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then accessing the value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by key path or by an offset pointer are equivalent. For example, for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variable ","type":"text"},{"code":"root","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"T","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a key path "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"type":"text","text":" of type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"WritableKeyPath<T, U>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and a "},{"code":"value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of type "},{"code":"U","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":["\/\/ Mutation through the key path","root[keyPath: key] = value","","\/\/ Mutation through the offset pointer","withUnsafeMutableBytes(of: &root) { bytes in","    let offset = MemoryLayout<T>.offset(of: key)!","    let rawPointerToValue = bytes.baseAddress! + offset","    let pointerToValue = rawPointerToValue.assumingMemoryBound(to: U.self)","    pointerToValue.pointee = value","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A property has inline, directly addressable storage when it is a stored","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property for which no additional work is required to extract or set the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value. Properties are not directly accessible if they trigger any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"didSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"willSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" accessors, perform any representation changes such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as bridging or closure reabstraction, or mask the value out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overlapping storage as for packed bitfields. In addition, because class","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance properties are always stored out-of-line, their positions are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not accessible using ","type":"text"},{"code":"offset(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProductCategory"},{"type":"text","text":" type defined here, only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\.updateCounter"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\.identifier"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\.identifier.name"},{"type":"text","text":" refer to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties with inline, directly addressable storage:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct ProductCategory {","    struct Identifier {","        var name: String              \/\/ addressable","    }","","    var identifier: Identifier        \/\/ addressable","    var updateCounter: Int            \/\/ addressable","    var products: [Product] {         \/\/ not addressable: didSet handler","        didSet { updateCounter += 1 }","    }","    var productCount: Int {           \/\/ not addressable: computed property","        return products.count","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offset(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with a type imported from a library, don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assume that future versions of the library will have the same behavior."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a property is converted from a stored property to a computed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property, the result of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offset(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" changes to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":". That kind of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conversion is nonbreaking in other contexts, but would trigger a runtime"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error if the result of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offset(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is force-unwrapped."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/MemoryLayout"]]},"references":{"Swift-PageImage-card.png":{"identifier":"Swift-PageImage-card.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/com.apple.Swift\/Swift-PageImage-card@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]},{"url":"\/images\/com.apple.Swift\/Swift-PageImage-card~dark@2x.png","traits":["2x","dark"]}],"type":"image","alt":"An orange Swift logo on a gradient background."},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/MemoryLayout":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/memorylayout","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/do